  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TH 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua nuenu mene, bana betu, nudi bamanye bua dibuela dietu kunudi ne kadiakulua dia hatuhu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi hatuakadianjila kukenga, ne hakatuenzelabo bibi ku Filipoi, bu munudi bamanye, tuakakolesha mitshima mu Nzambi wetu bua kunuambila lumu luimpe lua Nzambi mu kuluangana kua bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua dinusengelela dietu kadiena dia mashimi anyi dia bukoya bua mutshima anyi dia lubombo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi bu muakatujadikabo kudi Nzambi bila kutekeye lumu luimpe mu bianza bietu, ke mutudi tuamba; kembu mutudi tusankisha bantu, kadi bu mutudi tusankisha Nzambi udi uteta mitshima yetu ne idi mimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua kabakatusangana nasha tshikondo tshimue ne mei a tshianyishanyisha, bu munudi bamanye, anyi ne tshia kubuikila nʼatshi lukuka; Nzambi udi mumanyi wa bualu ebu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyi bakebi ba butumbi kudi bantu, nasha kunudi nasha kudi bantu bakuabo; nasha tuetu tuakadi mua kuikala bujitu kunudi bu bapostolo ba Kilisto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tuakikala bu bana batekete munkatshi muenu, bu mudi ndeshi ukuongoluela bana bandi balela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku muomumue, bualu bua tuakatamba kumusua, tuakadi ne disanka dimpe bua kunuha, kendumu luimpe lua Nzambi nkayalu, kadi mioyo yetu kabidi, bualu bua nuakalua banangibue kutudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nudi nuvuluka, bana betu, mudimu wetu mukole ne lutatu luetu; butuku ne munya tuakenza mudimu bua katudivuishi bujitu hamʼbidi ha nasha umue wenu; nunku Nakanuambila lumu luimpe lua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu nudi bamanyi ne Nzambi udi mumanyi kabidi bu mutuakanuenzela nuenu badi bitabusha malu a tshijila ne adi makane ne adi kâi mua kubandibua; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bu munudi bamanye mutuakanuenzela muntu ne muntu wa munkatshi muenu, bu mudi tatu wenza ne bana bandi balela, hatuakanusengelela, hatuakanukolesha mitshima, hatuakanuambila dî, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua nuenu nuende bakanangane ne Nzambi, udi unubikila bua nuenu kubuela mu bukelenge buandi ne mu butumbi buandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muanda eu kabidi katuena tulekela kusakidila Nzambi ne, Hanuakangata dî dinuakunvua kutudi, dia Nzambi mene, nuakaditabusha, kembu dî dia bantu, kadi bu mudidi bushua, dî dia Nzambi mene, didi dienzesha munda muenu badi bitabusha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nuenu, bana betu, nuakalua bidikishi ba bena ekelesia ya Nzambi ya mu Yudaya mu Kilisto Yesu; bualu bua nuenu kabidi nuakakenga makenga muomumue kudi bena tshisamba tshienu, bu muakâkenga ba mu Yudaya kudi Bena Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakashiha Mukelenge Yesu ne baprofete, bakatuihata tuetu kabidi, kabena basankisha Nzambi, ne badi banyoka bantu bonso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badi batukanda bua tuetu katuakudi ne ba bisamba bia bende bua bobo basungidibue; nunku bobo badi bakumbasha mibi yabo misangu yonso; kadi hashishe tshishi tshiakafika kudibo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tuetu, bana betu, hatuakalekelangana nʼenu musangu muibi, tuakalua bu bana ba nshîa mu mubidi kadi kemu mutshima; tuakatamba kukeba kumonangana nʼenu ku mesu ne dijinga dikole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua tuakasua kulua kunudi kudi meme Paulo misangu ne misangu, kadi Satana wakatuhumbisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua ditekemena dietu didi tshinyi, anyi disanka dietu, anyi tshifulu tshia butumbi? Kabiena nuenu nkayenu, anyi, ku mpala kua Mukelenge wetu Yesu ku dilua diandi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nuenu nudi butumbi buetu ne disanka dietu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
